WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:52.600
My name is Winjand
A P van Tilburg

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:54.720
and I work at King's College
London in the psychology department.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:05.040
One version contained an author

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:08.880
with no middle initials. 
The other versions had one,

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:13.080
two, three or four middle initials
instead. And what we found was

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:17.160
that students liked this written work
better if the author had more middle

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:21.840
initials - even though the exact text
of the essay was the same.

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:30.080
This is something to do with
the stereotypes that people use -

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:34.320
so because people with
middle initials are seen as more

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:38.360
prestigious, people automatically -
but incorrectly - assume that their

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:40.440
work must therefore be of a 
higher standard.

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:43.560
Thanks for watching. Don't forget to subscribe

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:46.480
